  "$id": "https://whodunnit.invalid/schemas/post-v3-successor-ready-execution-contract-v1",
  "title": "Post-V3 successor READY execution contract",
  "description": "Schema for a future READY artifact, not an artifact created by registration. All non-effort fields must match a committed pre-draw lock whose commit predates the fixed pulse. A separate semantic verifier checks timing, exact hashes, equality across stages and capture fidelity; shape validation alone never grants READY.",
